# Paths the `tauri dev` file watcher must NOT treat as source changes.
# The vendored Python runtime + site-packages live inside this crate dir; the
# sidecar interpreter writes .pyc bytecode into vendor/**/__pycache__ at import
# time, which otherwise triggers an endless "Rebuilding application" loop (one
# rebuild per .pyc → thousands of sidecar cold-restarts on startup).
vendor/
target/
